        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available now. Furnished or furnished penthouse apartment.\n\nGet Let letting agents are delighted to bring this two bedroom, two bathroom penthouse apartment to the rental market. Measuring approximately 90 sq. m., this stylish apartment is offered either furnished or unfurnished and is in excellent condition throughout.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a large entrance hallway providing access to all rooms. The spacious living room leads through to the fully fitted kitchen, which benefits from high-spec appliances.\n\nThere are two double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom further benefits from an ensuite bathroom. The main bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with a bath/shower unit. There are also two large storage presses off the hallway, providing ample storage throughout.\n\nThe apartment is dual aspect and benefits from two large balconies, with one overlooking the front of the development and the other to the rear, both with views towards the Dublin Mountains.\n\nThe apartment has gas central heating and was fitted with a brand-new boiler in September 2026. There is one designated parking space, with additional visitor parking available.\n\nCarrickmines Green is located adjacent to Carrickmines Retail Park, with amenities including TK Maxx, coffee shops and lunch spots nearby. Leopardstown Shopping Centre and Foxrock Village are also within easy reach.\n\nThe property is conveniently located for the M50, with Dundrum Town Centre and Dublin city centre easily accessible. The Luas Green Line is within walking distance, while Dublin Bus routes 63 and 44 also serve the area. Carrickmines Equestrian Centre, Carrickmines Croquet and Lawn Tennis Club and West Wood Health and Fitness Club are located nearby.\n\nPlease take advantage of the VR tour provided with this advertisement. Viewing is highly recommended. \n\nTo register your interest please email Gavin Mulcahy of Get Let by clicking on `Email Advertiser` to the right of this advertisement. Please submit a brief application with how many people it is for and when you wish to move home. All viewings shall be private, Get Let does not do group viewings. Get Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324.\n"
      },
